Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.46,Leg,,0,0,0,,Começa no dia 1º de outubro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:05.94,Leg,,0,0,0,,também conhecido como\Nquinta-feira agora,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:08.87,Leg,,0,0,0,,a 28ª edição do Festival do Rio,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.84,Leg,,0,0,0,,o maior da América Latina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:13.30,Leg,,0,0,0,,Vão ser mais de 300 filmes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:15.78,Leg,,0,0,0,,exibidos em várias mostras espalhadas pela cidade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.16,Leg,,0,0,0,,e, entre eles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:19.12,Leg,,0,0,0,,16 títulos pré-selecionados
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:21.66,Leg,,0,0,0,,para o Oscar de\NMelhor Filme Internacional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:24.26,Leg,,0,0,0,,E a GloboNews está presente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.55,Leg,,0,0,0,,em cinco documentários\Ndo Festival do Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:29.04,Leg,,0,0,0,,Alucinação Belchior,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:32.06,Leg,,0,0,0,,de Renato Terra,\NMarcos Caetano e Léo Caetano,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.51,Leg,,0,0,0,,na Mostra Première Brasil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:35.76,Leg,,0,0,0,,que aborda o disco Alucinação,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:38.12,Leg,,0,0,0,,do cantor Belchior,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.90,Leg,,0,0,0,,para revisitar a década de 70 no Brasil.
